    "Euclid", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "fee3efd0-d528-4567-8628-75ae29d400aa"], Cell[
    "Definition 23", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "a9e187dc-f9b2-44a7-ae08-5088fe8486e2"], Cell["\<\
Parallel lines are those in a plane which do not meet, however far produced.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"68624052-ef0f-4574-8668-71df4267cd12"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "edef617d-b304-4095-8cd8-a67912cd1b1a"], Cell[
