    "The parallel postulate.", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "56f3db76-e3b6-4997-a142-aa82b3cf9fc6"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "e116367f-9895-486d-bc7d-ab880b6a9d74"], Cell[
