     "4b118f29-0a57-4ec9-a06b-401ee5b9b5ad"], Cell["\<\
Playfair's axiom: exactly one parallel through a point off the line.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"fe3da4fa-bab0-4bad-a931-6d861edd0f20"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "3f9ff527-12fd-4267-9c0c-a7fdca00b817"], Cell[
